    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.multiBreak.desc": "啟則依優先之次第行操作。高先模式行時，低先者暫止。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.openScreen": "開設令選單",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.openScreen.desc": "開機巧設令選單之訣鍵（即今所見之頁）。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.placeBlocksPerTick": "每刻置石數",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.placeBlocksPerTick.desc": "每遊戲刻可置之石數。值愈高則摹形愈疾。\n設§b0§r則無上限。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.placeCooldown": "置石調息刻",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.placeCooldown.desc": "置同一石後須靜候之刻數，期滿方可再置。\n§c§l非必要勿設零，否則恐致多置、誤置之患！§r",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.placeInAir": "淩空置石",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.placeInAir.desc": "無視石需支撐之常理，直於空中置石（適無支之飾石）。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.placeInterval": "置石間隔刻",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.placeInterval.desc": "置石之間隔刻數。\n為防特殊石誤置，或自添延遲。\n設零或致限包伺服器上效不佳。\n摹紅石機關時不建議設零。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.placeRttAdaptiveInterval": "延遲自調之息",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.placeRttAdaptiveInterval.desc": "依爾之延遲(ping)，自抬置石之息，使不低於一往返之數，俾未得遠端覆驗前不遽發其次，故能減伺服之下誤置、虛石之患，延遲愈高愈驗。\n取玩家列之 ping 值；獨機、區網(ping 為零)則不施。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.placeRttSafetyPercent": "延遲安穩之率",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.placeRttSafetyPercent.desc": "取實測往返延遲(RTT)之此百分為置石最小之息。百者，恰一往返也。愈高愈穩而愈緩，愈低愈疾而愈易誤。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.print": "摹形",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printAutoFillComposter": "自填堆肥桶",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printAutoFillComposter.desc": "自向堆肥桶投可肥之物，以成骨粉。\n（§l警：此舉將耗囊中可肥之物！§r）",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printAutoFillComposterWhitelist": "自填堆肥桶 - 可用之物",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printAutoFillComposterWhitelist.desc": "自填堆肥桶時所取之可肥物冊。格式同前。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printAutoStripLogs": "自伐木皮",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printAutoStripLogs.desc": "啟後，若囊中無去皮原木，則先置常木，後自以斧去皮，省手動之工。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printAutoTuning": "自調音盒",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printAutoTuning.desc": "摹形音符盒時，自調其音合於圖樣所定。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printBonemealCrops": "糞肥催熟",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printBonemealCrops.desc": "以骨粉催熟農作物。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printBonemealCropsClicks": "農作催熟連點數",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printBonemealCropsClicks.desc": "每治一作物，連施骨粉之數。\n數愈高則催熟愈疾，然骨粉之耗亦愈甚。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printBreakExtraBlock": "破餘石",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printBreakExtraBlock.desc": "摹形時自破圖樣中本無之多出石。\n受摹形自破限制所制。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printBreakWrongBlock": "破誤石",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printBreakWrongBlock.desc": "摹形時自破與圖樣全然不合之石。\n受摹形自破限制所制。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printBreakWrongStateBlock": "破誤態石（試）",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printBreakWrongStateBlock.desc": "摹形時，石類合而態不合者自破之。\n連接之態及隨境而變之石略過。默認關。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printFallingBlockCheck": "察落石",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printFallingBlockCheck.desc": "啟後將察落石之下石是否合於圖樣，不合則越而不置。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printForcedSneak": "恆持潛行",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printForcedSneak.desc": "摹形之時自動保持潛行態。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printHotkey": "摹形訣鍵",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printHotkey.desc": "持此訣鍵時，機巧將持續置石。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printIceForWater": "破冰得水",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printIceForWater.desc": "以「置冰→破冰」之法生水源石，遂成水之摹形。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printMode.bedrock": "破基巖",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printMode.cover": "防生物之覆",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printMode.fill": "填方",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printMode.fluid": "治水",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printMode.mine": "採掘",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printMode.printer": "摹形",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printMode.replace": "替換",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printMode.replace.desc": "替石模式下，將選中之源石易為目標石。\n可入源石ID/譯名與目標石ID/譯名（以冒號隔），例：§bminecraft:stone:minecraft:oak_planks§r §b石:橡木板§r。\n前加§b#§r則為標籤配，例：§l#logs:minecraft:oak_planks§r（將萬木易為橡木板）。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printRepairRailShape": "自正鐵軌形",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printRepairRailShape.desc": "啟則置鐵軌後察 RailShape，若為鄰石更新所誤，最多破而重置三回。此乃客端盡力而為，非保萬形皆正。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printReplace": "覆摹 - 開關",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printReplace.desc": "直覆冊中之石，不越不破。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printReplaceCoral": "代死珊瑚",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printReplaceCoral.desc": "摹死珊瑚時，若囊無死珊瑚，則以活珊瑚代之；若二者俱有，則優用死珊瑚。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printReplaceableList": "覆摹 - 名冊",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printReplaceableList.desc": "摹形時可直覆之石冊（無須破原石）。格式同前。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printReserveItemCount": "繕材留數",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printReserveItemCount.desc": "每類實用繕材所留之最少數。至數則止耗，添材乃續。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printReserveItems": "留存繕材",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printReserveItems.desc": "啟之，繕機不耗材至所定留數之下。\n惟及繕築，不礙耐久器、手作及他法。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printSafelyObserver": "慎置觀察者",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printSafelyObserver.desc": "置觀察者前將察其位是否宜置，防誤觸機關而釃禍。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printSelectionType": "選界類",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printSelectionType.desc": "摹形模式工作界域則：同填方模式之選界類。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printSkip": "越置 - 開關",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printSkip.desc": "啟則摹形時將越冊中所列之石。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printSkipList": "越置 - 名冊",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printSkipList.desc": "摹形時越過之石冊。格式同前。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printSkipWaterlogged": "越含水石",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printSkipWaterlogged.desc": "摹形時越過含水之石。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printSortSides": "智能擇面",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printSortSides.desc": "啟後優先取近玩家視向、較易點中之置石面。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printSortTargets": "智能擇標",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printSortTargets.desc": "啟後優先處理手中之石相合、近視向、近玩家之摹形目標。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printerAutoDisable": "自偃機巧",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printerAutoDisable.desc": "玩家身殞時自關機巧，防重生後誤作。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printerIteratorShape": "工域形",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printerIteratorShape.desc": "機巧徧歷石之域形：\n§d立方§r：以§6§l工徑§r為稜之立方（薦值：三）\n§d球體§r：以§6§l工徑§r為徑之球（薦值：六）\n§d八面§r：以§6§l工徑§r為稜之八面體（薦值：六）",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printerLagCheck": "察遲滯",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printerLagCheck.desc": "機巧工時察包絡回傳之遲；\n若逾 伺服器TPS極值(預設二十) 之刻未收新包，\n則自暫工事，待包絡復通後續。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printerLagCheckMax": "伺服器極值",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printerLagCheckMax.desc": "以為察遲之上限。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printerMode": "工式",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printerMode.desc": "機巧之核心工式：\n§d摹形§r：還投影圖樣中之石（含朝向、態等屬）\n§d採掘§r：掘選界內之石（除流體）\n§d破基巖§r：藉遊戲機制毀選界內基巖（僅一·一九以上且備Bedrock Miner術可用）\n§d治水§r：以指定石填滿投影選中之液\n§d填方§r：以石填滿投影選界\n\n§l註：§r 除§d摹形§r式外，餘式之操界皆在投影選界內，亦可調各式之§6§l選界類§r而變。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printerRenderOnlyHoldingItems": "僅繪可用方塊",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printerRenderOnlyHoldingItems.desc": "僅繪背包（含潛影盒內物）所具之投影方塊。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printerSelectionType.desc": "摹形模式之工作界域則：同填方模式之選界類。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printerWorkingCountPerTick": "樞機 - 每刻行石數",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.printerWorkingCountPerTick.desc": "每遊戲刻可行之石操作數（僅摹形間隔設零時有效）。\n薦設二至八以衡速效，值過高或被伺服器逐。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.quickShulker": "速啟潛影盒 - 開關",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.quickShulker.desc": "直自囊中潛影盒取所需之材，以便速取。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.quickShulkerCooldown": "速啟潛影盒 - 調息刻",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.quickShulkerCooldown.desc": "速啟潛影盒功能之調息刻數，部分插件服對此有限。設零則閉調息。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.quickShulkerMode": "速啟潛影盒 - 工式",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.quickShulkerMode.click_slot": "擬點",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.quickShulkerMode.desc": "§d擬點§r：右點囊中潛影盒槽以啟（需伺服器插件支）\n§d召術§r：直召QuickShulker術以啟（需雙端俱備方可用）",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.quickShulkerMode.invoke": "召術",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.remoteTake": "Chest Tracker 遠取",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.remoteTake.desc": "有 Chest Tracker 時，只自明確加入當前 Litematica 投影選區之容器取缺材。快取按世界與維度隔離並存於本地；Chest Tracker 物品表右點取物亦只用此允許表。混合潛影盒可時歸還原箱槽位。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.renderHud": "顯工態",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.renderHud.desc": "機巧工時，於介面顯當前式與界內工進；若§6§l察遲滯§r開，則遲大時顯警。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.renderHudScale": "HUD縮放",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.renderHudScale.desc": "設一體HUD整體縮放之百分比。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.renderHudX": "HUD X座標",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.renderHudX.desc": "設一體HUD左上之X座標。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.renderHudY": "HUD Y座標",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.renderHudY.desc": "設一體HUD左上之Y座標。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.renderLayerLimit": "限渲染層",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.renderLayerLimit.desc": "限機巧工域為Litematica當前渲染之圖層界。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.scanTimeBudgetMs": "掃描時限",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.scanTimeBudgetMs.desc": "入口掃描器每 tick 可用主緒之時限，單位毫秒。\n此乃保險限，不是效能妙藥。值大則同 tick 掃描更多，亦可傷幀；值小則早讓至後 tick，尋標或稍遲。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.selectionType.litematica.renderLayer": "投影渲染層",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.selectionType.litematica.selection": "投影選界",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.selectionType.litematica.selection.abovePlayer": "投影選界（玩家之上 · 全）",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.selectionType.litematica.selection.abovePlayer.renderLayer": "投影選界（玩家之上 · 渲染層）",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.selectionType.litematica.selection.belowPlayer": "投影選界（玩家之下 · 全）",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.selectionType.litematica.selection.belowPlayer.renderLayer": "投影選界（玩家之下 · 渲染層）",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.storeOrderly": "物歸其位",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.storeOrderly.desc": "囊將滿則先歸久未用之速啟盒物，久不用亦自清；先歸原盒原格，不能盡納則次合於同物之疊，復用空格。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.switchPrinterMode": "切式",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.switchPrinterMode.desc": "切機巧當前之工式（摹形/採掘/破基巖等）。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.tweakerooAngelBlockMayBuild": "寬 Tweakeroo 憑空置石之限",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.tweakerooAngelBlockMayBuild.desc": "啟之，則 Tweakeroo 憑空置石雖生存亦可行；閉之，仍守其惟創造可用之舊制。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.unlockBeaconEffects": "解信標效限",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.unlockBeaconEffects.desc": "寬客端信標介面之效階限，得如 wacko-beacons 然，擇今階本不可擇之主效、副效。\n此不改服器校驗；能否真行，視服器猶存其隙、未加補綴與否。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.workRange": "工徑",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.workRange.desc": "機巧以玩家為心之最遠工徑（石），值愈大則覆域愈廣。此參與§6§l徧歷域形§r相關。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.workingSwitch": "工訣",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.config.workingSwitch.desc": "機巧之總開關。",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.free_notice": "諸語翻譯尚未周備，敬請襄助完善",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.hud.bedrock.counts": "成 %s | 敗 %s | 縱 %s/%s | 橫 %s/%s | 清 %s | 壓 %s",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.hud.bedrock.network": "待 %s | RTT退 %s | 更新逾時 %s | 末 %s",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.hud.bedrock.progress": "[基巖] 進 %s | 成率 %s | 成速 %s/秒",
    "litematica-printer-hana-6b6t.hud.bedrock.throughput": "吞吐 %s/窗隔 %s | 送 %s/%s | 阻 %s | 探 %s | 狀 %s",
